Package: flrig-subspace
Version: @VERSION@
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libfltk1.3t64 | libfltk1.3, libx11-6, libxft2, libudev1, libxinerama1, libxcursor1, libxfixes3, libxext6, libxrender1, libfontconfig1, libstdc++6, libc6
Maintainer: WM8Q <ssdev.avantol@xoxy.net>
Homepage: https://github.com/avantol/flrig-subspace
Description: flrig rig control with PTT fixes for Subspace Edition
 flrig 2.0.12 (W1HKJ, GPL-3.0) with fixes for stations that share one radio
 between several programs: a PTT race that could send key for unkey (and
 the reverse) is fixed, lock and serial-port fixes (by Ron, MAGNET group),
 and rig.reserve_ptt, which lets Subspace Edition clear the radio line just
 before it keys or unkeys. Installs beside a stock flrig as flrig-subspace;
 both use ~/.flrig and port 12345, so run one at a time.
